      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Moseley proved atomic number (Z) is the true basis of classification, correcting Mendeleev's atomic mass approach.",
        "Electronegativity and ionization energy increase from left to right across a period and decrease down a group.",
        "Modern Periodic Table consists of 18 vertical groups and 7 horizontal periods, where Group 18 contains Noble Gases."
